{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BqO6bzYTwk1795567635.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>信和置業與母公司等合資投得新加坡地皮，按權益出資約21.3億港元。</p><p></p><p>地皮位於新加坡裕廊湖區的Town Hall Link，將發展為綜合用途發展項目，包括作出售用途的住宅部分，以及作投資持有用途的寫字樓及零售部分，投標價18.23億新加坡元、折合約111億港元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:03:56.098211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T00:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T12:17:15.921512+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T01:57:17.569236+00:00","content_hash":"b2d2d4c4c4a2f772db3eb593be4f16b470bed98d9787aaa2b25a0594cad3f755","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T02:03:56.098211+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}